# Code style (formatters)

- ALWAYS Biome for JS/TS packages when `biome.json` is present.
- ALWAYS `rustfmt` for Rust when `rustfmt.toml` / Cargo project is present.
- ALWAYS Ruff format for Python when Ruff is configured (`uv run ruff format`).
- React projects sort Tailwind classes with Prettier and
  `prettier-plugin-tailwindcss`. Biome still formats JS/TS.
- After large edits: run the project format script (`pnpm format` / `npm run format`
  / `cargo fmt`) before validate.
